### Case: quota-backend-unreachable — manual, controlled environments only.
###
### With the quota backend unreachable and error_policy fail_close (the default),
### expect 503: the gateway refuses rather than silently serving unmetered traffic.
###
### Then flip error_policy to fail_open and repeat — the call should succeed,
### unmetered. Run both halves once, deliberately. Which one you want is a
### commercial decision, not a default to inherit.
GET {{GATEWAY}}/orders
apikey: {{FREE_KEY}}
accept: application/json
